                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "faq-list",
                  "type": "widget",
                  "props": {
                    "widget": "faq",
                    "config": {
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "q": "What is the International S13 Integrated Powertrain?",
                          "a": "The S13 is an engine, transmission and aftertreatment system designed to work as one. It is simple, easy to service, and delivers stellar performance with superior operating economy. Spec sheets are available for the LT and RH Series and the HX Series."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Which trucks can be ordered with the S13?",
                          "a": "S13 spec sheets are available for the LT and RH Series and the HX Series. Call or contact us to confirm what is available for the unit you are considering."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Which International series brochures are available?",
                          "a": "Brochures and spec sheets are listed on this page for the MV, eMV, HV, LT, RH, HX and CV Series and for LoneStar."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Are the brochures free to download?",
                          "a": "Yes. All files are free PDF downloads, no form required."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "How does International compare to competitors?",
                          "a": "Competitive comparison documents are available for the CV, HX and LT Series. They are listed above under “See how International stacks up against the competition.”"
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Where can I get trailer specifications?",
                          "a": "Contact our trailer sales team with the application you have in mind and they can send the right specification sheet."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "snapshot": {
                      "items": []
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
